      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>
            page
          </strong>
           (optional): Page number to retrieve (default: 1)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>
            limit
          </strong>
           (optional): Number of films per page (default: 10, maximum: 100)
        </li>
      </ul>
